483 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 390 0 R
/E (By combining AI-powered disease detection with climate-based optimization, Silkworm Disease Detection Using Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning offers a comprehensive solution for modern sericulture management. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
484 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 390 0 R
/E (Sericulture, a vital agro-based industry, is highly susceptible to diseases that can significantly reduce silk production and economic returns. Traditional disease detection methods rely on manual inspection, which is time-consuming, labor-intensive, and prone to errors. To address these challenges, Silkworm disease detection system, leverages deep learning to identify and classify silkworm diseases with high accuracy. By employing convolutional neural networks \(CNNs\), the system can analyze silkworm images, detect infections at an early stage, and provide real-time alerts to farmers, enabling timely intervention and preventing widespread disease outbreaks.In addition to disease detection, It integrates climate-based cocoon optimization to enhance silk yield and quality. Using advanced machine learning models, the system analyzes environmental factors such as temperature, humidity, and air quality to recommend optimal rearing conditions. A predictive framework powered by EfficientNetB3 algorithm and detect the different disease. This data-driven approach ensures better disease prevention, improves cocoon quality, and enhances overall sericulture productivity.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
