/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 395 0 R
/T (1.4 Proposed System  The proposed system, Silkworm Disease Detection Using Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning, is an AI-powered sericulture disease detection platform designed to accurately identify and classify silkworm diseases through image analysis using deep learning techniques. The core of the system will leverage a pre-trained convolutional neural network \(CNN\) model, such as EfficientNet-B3, fine-tuned on a curated dataset of healthy and diseased silkworm images. The model will be trained to detect visual symptoms of common silkworm infections, enabling early and reliable diagnosis. )
/E (1.4 Proposed System  The proposed system, Silkworm Disease Detection Using Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning, is an AI-powered sericulture disease detection platform designed to accurately identify and classify silkworm diseases through image analysis using deep learning techniques. The core of the system will leverage a pre-trained convolutional neural network \(CNN\) model, such as EfficientNet-B3, fine-tuned on a curated dataset of healthy and diseased silkworm images. The model will be trained to detect visual symptoms of common silkworm infections, enabling early and reliable diagnosis. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
