<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 395 0 R
/T (The system will feature a user-friendly mobile and web-based application where farmers can upload images of silkworms taken using their smartphones. Upon uploading, the system will process the image in real time, run it through the trained CNN model, and return the diagnosis along with actionable suggestions or preventive measures. The platform will also include a real-time alert mechanism to notify farmers immediately of potential outbreaks and encourage timely intervention. )
/E (The system will feature a user-friendly mobile and web-based application where farmers can upload images of silkworms taken using their smartphones. Upon uploading, the system will process the image in real time, run it through the trained CNN model, and return the diagnosis along with actionable suggestions or preventive measures. The platform will also include a real-time alert mechanism to notify farmers immediately of potential outbreaks and encourage timely intervention. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
624 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 395 0 R
/T (In addition, the system will maintain a disease occurrence database for continuous learning and improved accuracy over time. It will be designed to be scalable, allowing integration with future modules like environmental condition monitoring, pest detection, or multilingual support. Ultimately, Silkworm Disease Detection Using Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning aims to offer a low-cost, accessible, and intelligent tool for improving disease management in sericulture, especially for small and medium-scale farmers. )
/E (In addition, the system will maintain a disease occurrence database for continuous learning and improved accuracy over time. It will be designed to be scalable, allowing integration with future modules like environmental condition monitoring, pest detection, or multilingual support. Ultimately, Silkworm Disease Detection Using Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning aims to offer a low-cost, accessible, and intelligent tool for improving disease management in sericulture, especially for small and medium-scale farmers. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [10]
>>
