/T (Abstract: Cotton is known as 'white gold' in the agricultural industry. Numerous diseases affect crop production and cause enormous crop losses, endangering the lives of farmers. This research proposes a deep learning-based cotton leaf disease detection approach using fine-tuning transfer learning algorithms. The study investigates the performance of several fine-tuned models such as VGG-16, )
