/T (Thisstudydevelops an integrated pestand diseaserecognitionsystemfor agricultural drones, leveraging deep learning technologies to improve detection accuracy and efficiency. By employing convolutional neural networks \(CNN\) alongside high- definition image acquisition and wireless data transmission, the system effectively identifies and classifies various agricultural pests and diseases. Comparative analyses reveal that this system offers notable enhancements in both accuracy and response time over traditional detection methods, optimizing agricultural pest and disease management. )
