/T (Image Dataset Creation: Collect a comprehensive set of labeled silkworm images showing various common diseases \(e.g., grasserie, flacherie, muscardine, pebrine\) and healthy specimens.  Data Augmentation: Apply techniques like rotation, flipping, zooming, and brightness adjustment to expand the dataset and improve model generalization. Image Preprocessing: Resize images, normalize pixel values, and convert to appropriate formats for training \(e.g., 224x224x3 for EfficientNet-B3\). )
/E (Image Dataset Creation: Collect a comprehensive set of labeled silkworm images showing various common diseases \(e.g., grasserie, flacherie, muscardine, pebrine\) and healthy specimens.  Data Augmentation: Apply techniques like rotation, flipping, zooming, and brightness adjustment to expand the dataset and improve model generalization. Image Preprocessing: Resize images, normalize pixel values, and convert to appropriate formats for training \(e.g., 224x224x3 for EfficientNet-B3\). )
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [16]
