<<
/Title (1.4 Proposed System  The proposed system, Silkworm Disease Detection Using Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning, is an AI-powered sericulture disease detection platform designed to accurately identify and classify silkworm diseases through image analysis using deep learning techniques. The core of the system will leverage a pre-trained convolutional neural network \(CNN\) model, such as EfficientNet-B3, fine-tuned on a curated dataset of healthy and diseased silkworm images. The model will be trained to detect visual symptoms of common silkworm infections, enabling early and reliable diagnosis.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4113 0 R
/Next 4193 0 R
>>
endobj
4151 0 obj
<<
/Title (In addition, the system will maintain a disease occurrence database for continuous learning and improved accuracy over time. It will be designed to be scalable, allowing integration with future modules like environmental condition monitoring, pest detection, or multilingual support. Ultimately, Silkworm Disease Detection Using Artificial Intelligence and Machine Learning aims to offer a low-cost, accessible, and intelligent tool for improving disease management in sericulture, especially for small and medium-scale farmers.)
/Dest [18 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4113 0 R
/Prev 4193 0 R
>>
endobj
