4663 0 obj
<<
/Title (initiatives.  Return on Investment \(ROI\): The cost of implementing and maintaining the system is outweighed by the increase in yield quality and quantity, making it a profitable investment for farmers and stakeholders.  Long-Term Savings: Reduces reliance on chemical treatments and late-  stage interventions, lowering long-term operating costs for farmers.)
/Dest [32 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4643 0 R
/Prev 4671 0 R
/Next 4654 0 R
>>
endobj
4664 0 obj
<<
/Title (User-Friendly Interface: Designed with a simple and intuitive mobile or web interface to accommodate users with limited technical literacy.Visual cues and minimal text ensure accessibility even in low-literacy regions.  Minimal Technical Expertise Required: Farmers only need to take and upload images of silkworms; the backend AI handles analysis and diagnosis.Step-by-step guidance can be embedded into the app to support first-time users.  Language and Localization Support: The system can be localized in  regional languages, making it more accessible to native sericulture workers.  Quick and Reliable Diagnosis: Real-time feedback allows farmers to act  immediately, improving disease management without delays.Reduces  reliance on manual inspection or waiting for experts.  Integrates with Existing Farming Practices: No change in how farmers  raise silkworms; the system only enhances disease monitoring.Compatible  with current mobile usage habits among rural populations.  Low Infrastructure Dependence: Can function with low-bandwidth)
/Dest [32 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 4644 0 R
/Prev 4655 0 R
/Next 4672 0 R
>>
endobj
